Marp mathematics contract:
- Use only dollar-sign delimiters in slide Markdown: `$...$` for inline math and `$$...$$` for display math.
- Never use LaTeX-style `\(...\)` or `\[...\]` delimiters. Marp leaves those delimiters as literal text instead of rendering the formula.
- Keep inline math on the surrounding prose line. Put display math in a standalone `$$...$$` block.
- Preserve the TeX expression inside the delimiters exactly. Do not put math delimiters inside Mermaid diagrams or code fences.
